;; compiler/emit/lower/call.fib: calls: the site protocol (arguments, copy-in, target, the call, write-back, tail calls) and targets.
;; Replaces crates/fibc/src/lower/call.rs; `Target` is in emit.lower.cx.
;; STATUS: every public function below is a STUB of package E5, `(trap "todo: PACKAGE NAME")`,
;; with the Rust it replaces in the comment above it (crates/fibc/src/lower/call.rs, 431 lines of Rust).
;; A stub reached makes a tool exit 70 (pending, never a pass); its signature is final for the callers,
;; the data it names is the porter's to extend.
(ns emit.lower.call
  (:use types.ty types.scheme types.ast types.decls own.program emit.value emit.ir emit.program emit.lower.cx))

